        <mxCell id="dataTerms" value="SceneFlow Driving: 1000 pairs, stratified&#10;800 train / 200 held-out (seed 42)&#10;4 near-black tunnel frames nuked (A05 lesson)&#10;dark-tunnel cluster still present: 20+ frames&#10;mean brightness &lt; 45 — spikes possible&#10;&#10;Why 1000: architecture axis exhausted&#10;(B/E/V/D gave ≤0.33 each); the 2× gap&#10;to the 1.89 control is data volume&#10;(160 pairs → 800; control used 35,000)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1255" y="504" width="300" height="180" as="geometry" />
