        <mxCell id="score" value="SCOREBOARD (200-pair protocol, 15k steps, held-out EPE)&#10;A03 same head+encoder, old smooth-L1 loss: 5.66  |  official pretrained control: 1.89&#10;B no-fusion 4.26 (loss fix −25%)  ·  E excite 4.10  ·  V veto 3.93 ★  ·  D guide 3.98  ·  V+D 4.02 (best-ckpt 3.75, unstable)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
